     Claude Code loads CLAUDE.local.md after CLAUDE.md. Never copy its content into a tracked file. -->

## Private documents

- `private-docs/`: plans and notes that must not be public. Read them only when the owner asks.
- `private-docs/privacy-terms.txt`: one private term a line (names, internal URLs, other project names, machine
  details). `node tools/check.mjs fast` fails when one appears in a file that git would publish.

## The owner's working agreements (examples; keep the ones you want)

- **Explain in plain language as you go.** Beside the technical account, say what the change or result means in terms
  a non-engineer can follow. For highly technical material, use an everyday comparison, define each term the first
  time, and say what it means for the decision the owner must make and what it does not show.
- **Match the model to the stage, and stop for the switch.** Before design work, stop and offer the switch to the
  strongest model. Before the first line of implementation, stop again and offer the switch to a faster one.

